    ButtonBox["HandlerFunctions",
     BaseStyle->"Link"], 
    RowBox[{"<|", "|>"}], Cell["\<\
HandlerFunctions is an option that specifies functions to apply when events \
are generated. These will be evaluated by the main kernel\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"11e1a9df-7349-4e15-b1d8-6b542bc4b436"]},
   {Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
