Cell["URLDispatcher can be used to specify different routes:", "ExampleText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.957599667423999*^9, 3.9575996919914923`*^9}, {
  3.9576043080378447`*^9, 3.9576043761327267`*^9}, {3.9576046134940166`*^9, 
